    Visual Music MSVC build glue for libsidplayfp 3.0.1.

    Upstream ships autotools only; this project file is part of the (build-files
    only) fork delta. Sources are globbed over the trees Visual Music needs so
    that future upstream bumps are mostly "git submodule update" + rebuild; the
    only hand-maintained pieces are the Remove exclusions below and config.h.

    The ReSIDfp engine lives in the separate libresidfp submodule (../libresidfp);
    only the thin residfp-builder bridge is compiled here.
